        "slc_94110bb943e6de06c83839cbbf9e4e64600a27c5adcfff1d0c1e3543a46612de"
      ],
      "text": "The UI offers three graph views — Canvas (default), Wheel, and Districts treemap — switchable from the toolbar or command palette, each honoring the active lens, selection, collapsed directories, and search filter."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
