        "slc_2759d329f967e029cb6351bfe495e15759e6510c96d46973b3007003b50bb025"
      ],
      "text": "Flare deliberately does not lock files, arguing a lock would be an ignorable request that can silently fail open; instead agents announce intentions in a Channel and contention is surfaced on the graph and in review."
    },
