      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3bd1fdb20c7954307fd3acd21efa5b9a735e751628020ad206ed79633872daf7"
      ],
      "text": "A routine wizard configures agent behavior when out of work: re-check the board, record design decisions as proposals a human must approve, park questions instead of halting, and an editable working agreement returned by the working_agreement tool."
    },
